  "description": "Hyun-Jae Moon, a beta, has been in a loving relationship with alpha Shin-Hoo Lee for seven years. But all this changes when Shin-Hoo sacrifices himself to save Hyun-Jae from a terrible accident. When Shin-Hoo wakes up in the hospital, he doesn’t recognize Hyun-Jae or have any memories of their time together. All Shin-Hoo wants now is a man who can handle his intense desires, but does a beta have the stamina to keep up with him? With their relationship in shambles, how can Hyun-Jae win Shin-Hoo back?\n\n(Source: Tapas)",
